<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia 91-day t-bill average yield at 6.49 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia 91-day t-bill average yield at 6.49 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara Malaysia said it accepted bids at an average yield of 6.49 percent at its auction of 91-day treasury bills for 100 million ringgit.</p>
<p>At its previous auction on September 26 for a similar amount, the central bank accepted bids at an average yield of 6.517 percent.</p>
<p>The bids accepted were in the high/low range of 6.500/475 percent against 6.520/505 percent last week.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
